# UI theme

- Default direction: soft light CRM/ops Admin (`docs/ui-theme.md`).
- Components use semantic tokens only (`--color-canvas`, `--color-surface`, `--color-accent`, …).
- Themes change by swapping token maps — not by rewriting feature pages.
- Avoid purple-indigo gradient defaults, loud glassmorphism, and decorative card stacks for ops screens.
- Prefer tables, inboxes, and pipelines for Admin density; cards only when they aid interaction.
